    {
        "content": "<p>I have <code>if h : c then &lt;true conv&gt; else &lt;false conv&gt;</code> implemented here <a href=\"https://github.com/lecopivo/SciLean/blob/master/SciLean/Tactic/ConvIf.lean\">https://github.com/lecopivo/SciLean/blob/master/SciLean/Tactic/ConvIf.lean</a><br>\nI don't know how to support general match unfortunately.</p>",
