    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Also here I have conv induction on Nat and List<br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/lecopivo/SciLean/blob/master/SciLean/Tactic/ConvInduction.lean\">https://github.com/lecopivo/SciLean/blob/master/SciLean/Tactic/ConvInduction.lean</a><br>\nThe problem that it generates recursor so if you want to optimize exacutable expression you are will have a problem as general recursors are not supported by the compiler.</p>",
